  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& 1^{\\text {st }} \\text { term } \\rightarrow 1,2^{\\text {nd }} \\text { term }=2,4^{\\text {th }} \\text { term } \\rightarrow 3, \\\\\n& 7^{\\text {th }} \\text { term } \\rightarrow 4,11^{\\text {th }} \\text { term } \\rightarrow 5, \\ldots\n\\end{aligned}\\)\nSeries is \\(1,2,4,7,11, \\ldots\\)\n\\(a_n=1+\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}=\\frac{n^2-n+2}{2}\\)\nIf \\(n=14\\), then \\(a_n=92, \\mathrm{If} n=15\\), then \\(a_n=106\\).",
